> EXPLAINATION:
[ver] = OS version or SRV/SYSTEM version depending in the context
[SYSTEM] = usually means the terminal called in the script "ZeroKI++" which you run commands trough
[SRV] = usually the server (script)

> How do i use it?
click on the file you downloaded into your PC by going into file explorer > downloads > ZeroKI[ver]++

> What are the requirements for the system and server?
OS: Windows 10/11
